# README is the control document

`README.md` is the source of truth for what Mantis is, what someone needs to run it, how to start it, and how to use it.

When a change alters setup, dependencies, launch steps, roles, screens, the library, publishing, or AI configuration, update `README.md` in the same change. Match the product name Mantis. Do not document behavior that the code does not implement.
